  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aSmCp8G.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1484\" height=\"957\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>\"歡迎來到費瑞·法茲熊披薩店。一個充滿奇幻與歡樂的神奇之地！\"</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/The_Five_Nights_at_Freddys_Mod/BH_TFNAFM_banner1.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"824\" height=\"103\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">這個模組將《玩具熊的五夜驚魂》的恐怖帶入你的我的世界！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本模組收錄了系列作中的角色</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">基於所有《玩具熊的五夜驚魂》媒體內容的自訂建築結構</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">以及可運作的監視器！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">還有更多功能即將推出！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fDevMultiverse\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方合作夥伴：Bisect Hosting！使用優惠碼：DevMultiverse，首購享 25% 折扣</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fDevMultiverse\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/The_Five_Nights_at_Freddys_Mod/BH_TFNAFM_promo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"628\" height=\"131\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/The_Five_Nights_at_Freddys_Mod/BH_TFNAFM_banner2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ke2bF9f8TE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/513493/description_8c61b755-377c-4369-9110-a816f4d50f16.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"178\" height=\"52\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/MephilisDevMultiverse\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/513493/description_1edb5a8c-e8ae-4dbb-a2e8-90f884f4f296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"168\" height=\"52\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/ModFnaf\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/513493/description_5b07a4bb-dd4e-44bd-